# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that the first qubit listed in `qc.cx(0,1)` is the control, and the "
"second is the target. Diagrammatically, the target is the one with the \"+\""
" sign or cross on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"`qc.cx(0,1)`에서 첫 번째로 나열된 Qubit이 제어이고 두 번째가 타겟입니다. 도식적으로는 \"+\" 기호 또는 십자가 표시가"
" 있는 쪽이 타겟입니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$R_y(\\theta)$ Rotation Y gate: Rotates the state about the y-axis. This is a single-qubit gate.\n"
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta)|0\\rangle = \\cos(\\theta/2)|0\\rangle+\\sin(\\theta/2)|1\\rangle,\\\\R_y(\\theta)|0\\rangle = -\\sin(\\theta/2)|0\\rangle+\\cos(\\theta/2)|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta)=\\begin{bmatrix} \\cos(\\theta/2) & -\\sin(\\theta/2) \\\\ \\sin(\\theta/2) & \\cos(\\theta/2) \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$R_y(\\theta)$ 회전 Y Gate: 상태를 y 축을 중심으로 회전시킵니다. 단일 qubit Gate입니다.\n"
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta)|0\\rangle = \\cos(\\theta/2)|0\\rangle+\\sin(\\theta/2)|1\\rangle,\\\\R_y(\\theta)|0\\rangle = -\\sin(\\theta/2)|0\\rangle+\\cos(\\theta/2)|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta)=\\begin{bmatrix} \\cos(\\theta/2) & -\\sin(\\theta/2) \\\\ \\sin(\\theta/2) & \\cos(\\theta/2) \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, rotation gates are implemented by specifying the type of gate, the "
"amount of the rotation, and the qubit on which the gate is placed, in that "
"order:\n"
msgstr "마지막으로, 회전 Gate는 Gate의 종류, 회전량, 그리고 Gate가 적용될 qubit 순서로 지정합니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-"
"mechanics/bells-inequality-with-qiskit/extracted-"
"outputs/f4eddadc-834e-48e8-b190-dfc7727c2b79-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-"
"mechanics/bells-inequality-with-qiskit/extracted-"
"outputs/f4eddadc-834e-48e8-b190-dfc7727c2b79-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The name of the gate `ry` specifies the axis about which the rotation "
"occurs. The first argument $\\pi/2$ refers to the amount of the rotation, "
"and the second argument specifies the qubit on which the gate is to be "
"placed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gate 이름 `ry`는 회전이 이루어지는 축을 나타냅니다. 첫 번째 인수 $\\pi/2$는 회전량을 나타내며, 두 번째 인수는 "
"Gate가 적용될 Qubit을 지정합니다.\n"

